WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.133 --> 00:00:02.601
-Hi, Paris.
-Hey.

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.067
-I'm so happy
you're back on the show.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.434
-I love being here.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:07.701
Did you hear about this
new pepper called Pepper X?

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:09.934
It's supposed to be
pretty spicy.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.200
I got one if you want to try it.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.467
-Sure, I'll try it.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:14.467
[ Crunches ]

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:15.968
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:00:15.968 --> 00:00:21.901
♪♪

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:23.467
-That's hot.

